+|---|---:|---:|---:|
+| 1,000 | 37.6–42.6ms PASS | 41.2–45.6ms PASS | 40.7–45.9ms PASS |
+| 5,000 | 111.3–117.5ms PASS | 113.8–121.0ms PASS | 114.6–117.4ms FAIL |
